{
  "description": "仅在用户要求时调用：把任务开始时选中的全部对象、子对象、源码依赖与素材一起保存到我的资产库。软件维护选区和身份，无需列举对象 ID；省略 path 使用任务绑定的多选范围，指定 project.list/read 对象路径则只提炼该对象。可附 title、说明、学科、学段与标签；之后用 asset.search 检索及 asset.use 插入。",
  "inputSchema": {
    "$schema": "https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema",
    "additionalProperties": false,
    "properties": {
      "description": {
        "type": "string"
      },
      "path": {
        "minLength": 1,
        "type": "string"
      },
      "project": {
        "minLength": 1,
        "type": "string"
      },
      "schoolStage": {
        "items": {
          "minLength": 1,
          "type": "string"
        },
        "type": "array"
      },
      "subject": {
        "items": {
          "minLength": 1,
          "type": "string"
        },
        "type": "array"
      },
      "tags": {
        "items": {
          "minLength": 1,
          "type": "string"
        },
        "type": "array"
      },
      "title": {
        "minLength": 1,
        "type": "string"
      }
    },
    "type": "object"
  },
  "invocation": "静态目录只说明已登记接口；当前运行是否可调用、文档范围、写权限、短句柄和服务配置，以宿主本轮发现与实际回执为准。",
  "manual": {
    "group": "edit",
    "label": "asset.save",
    "targetKinds": []
  },
  "name": "asset.save",
  "version": 1
}
